Bug 2070351 - Correct remaining boolean attribute handling in mail UI. r=mkmelin

Use presence semantics for boolean disabled and checked attributes throughout
the mail UI. This makes the first filter row removable once another search
condition exists.

Disabled compose color buttons no longer open the color picker, such as before
the editor receives focus.

Remove the obsolete context-menu attribute helper and set the media menu items'
disabled properties directly. Play/Pause and Mute/Unmute remain enabled for
valid HTML audio and video while staying disabled for media errors.

The attachment-bar checkbox now persists the start-expanded preference
correctly. Add regression coverage for the filter-row remove button and
attachment-bar preference.

(Followup to bug 2008907)

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324767

